236	// repository.
237	//
238	// It says in one cell what the Type column used to say in thirteen, and it says
239	// it in no forge's words — which is the one thing lost and the one thing gained.
240	// Lost: a GitHub user no longer reads "Organization" on the row. Gained: the
241	// personal account's row no longer *claims* to be one (see docs/architecture/
242	// forge.md), and the vocabulary moved to the help legend, where nodeTypeLabel
243	// still resolves it and where a sentence has room to be right.
